<title>JAPAN: Sakura Bank may take over credit union's business.</title>
<headline>Sakura Bank may take over credit union's business.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sakura Bank Ltd may take over the business of Tanabe Shinyo Kumiai, an ailing Osaka-based credit union, Osaka prefectural government sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The sources said that a decision on the issue could be announced later in the day.</p>
</text>
